{"seq":1,"slug":"hooks-internals","title":"Hooks 内部机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/hooks-mastery/hooks-internals","wordCount":674,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"hooks-内部机制\">Hooks 内部机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Hooks 的状态并不存在组件函数自己身上，而是挂在组件对应 Fiber 节点的 <code>memoizedState</code> 上，以链表形式按调用顺序串联。React 通过 Dispatcher 在 Mount 与 Update 阶段切换不同的 Hook 实现，<code>useState</code> 在底层是 <code>useReducer</code> 的语法糖。本章剖析 Hook 链表的存储结构、Dispatcher 分发机制、<code>useState</code> 的两阶段实现，并解释 Rules of Hooks 为何要求调用顺序稳定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hooks-的存储结构\">Hooks 的存储结构</h2><p>每个函数组件对应一个 Fiber 节点，该节点的 <code>memoizedState</code> 属性指向一个 <strong>Hook 链表</strong>。组件中每次调用一个 Hook（如 <code>useState</code>、<code>useEffect</code>），都会在链表中创建一个节点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    F[&quot;Fiber Node&quot;] --&gt;|memoizedState| H1[&quot;Hook 1 (useState)&quot;]&#10;    H1 --&gt;|next| H2[&quot;Hook 2 (useEffect)&quot;]&#10;    H2 --&gt;|next| H3[&quot;Hook 3 (useMemo)&quot;]&#10;    H3 --&gt;|next| N[&quot;null&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    F[\"Fiber Node\"] --&gt;|memoizedState| H1[\"Hook 1 (useState)\"]\n    H1 --&gt;|next| H2[\"Hook 2 (useEffect)\"]\n    H2 --&gt;|next| H3[\"Hook 3 (useMemo)\"]\n    H3 --&gt;|next| N[\"null\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Hook {&#10;  memoizedState: any;&#10;  baseState: any;&#10;  baseQueue: Update&lt;any&gt; | null;&#10;  queue: UpdateQueue&lt;any&gt; | null;&#10;  next: Hook | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface UpdateQueue&lt;S&gt; {&#10;  pending: Update&lt;S&gt; | null;&#10;  dispatch: ((action: any) =&gt; void) | null;&#10;  lastRenderedReducer: ((state: S, action: any) =&gt; S) | null;&#10;  lastRenderedState: S | null;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Hook</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  memoizedState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  baseState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  baseQueue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  queue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UpdateQueue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Hook</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UpdateQueue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">S</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pending</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">S</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dispatch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lastRenderedReducer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> S</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> S</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lastRenderedState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> S</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>不同 Hook 类型在 <code>memoizedState</code> 中存储的内容各不相同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hook</th>\n<th>memoizedState 存储内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>useState</code></td>\n<td>当前 state 值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>useReducer</code></td>\n<td>当前 state 值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>useEffect</code></td>\n<td>Effect 对象（create, destroy, deps）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>useMemo</code></td>\n<td><code>[计算结果, deps]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>useCallback</code></td>\n<td><code>[回调函数, deps]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>useRef</code></td>\n<td><code>{ current: value }</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"dispatcher-分发器\">Dispatcher 分发器</h2><p>React 根据组件的渲染阶段选择不同的 <strong>Dispatcher</strong>（分发器），决定 Hook 函数的具体实现：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[调用 useState] --&gt; B{当前 Dispatcher?}&#10;    B --&gt;|Mount 阶段| C[mountState: 创建新 Hook]&#10;    B --&gt;|Update 阶段| D[updateState: 复用已有 Hook]&#10;    B --&gt;|无效调用| E[throwInvalidHookError]\">flowchart TD\n    A[调用 useState] --&gt; B{当前 Dispatcher?}\n    B --&gt;|Mount 阶段| C[mountState: 创建新 Hook]\n    B --&gt;|Update 阶段| D[updateState: 复用已有 Hook]\n    B --&gt;|无效调用| E[throwInvalidHookError]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const HooksDispatcherOnMount = {&#10;  useState: mountState,&#10;  useEffect: mountEffect,&#10;  useRef: mountRef,&#10;  useMemo: mountMemo,&#10;  useCallback: mountCallback,&#10;};&#10;&#10;const HooksDispatcherOnUpdate = {&#10;  useState: updateState,&#10;  useEffect: updateEffect,&#10;  useRef: updateRef,&#10;  useMemo: updateMemo,&#10;  useCallback: updateCallback,&#10;};&#10;&#10;function renderWithHooks(current: FiberNode | null, workInProgress: FiberNode, Component: Function, props: any): any {&#10;  if (current !== null &amp;&amp; current.memoizedState !== null) {&#10;    ReactCurrentDispatcher.current = HooksDispatcherOnUpdate;&#10;  } else {&#10;    ReactCurrentDispatcher.current = HooksDispatcherOnMount;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const children = Component(props);&#10;&#10;  ReactCurrentDispatcher.current = ContextOnlyDispatcher;&#10;&#10;  return children;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> HooksDispatcherOnMount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  useState: mountState,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  useEffect: mountEffect,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  useRef: mountRef,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  useMemo: mountMemo,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  useCallback: mountCallback,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> HooksDispatcherOnUpdate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  useState: updateState,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  useEffect: updateEffect,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  useRef: updateRef,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  useMemo: updateMemo,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  useCallback: updateCallback,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> renderWithHooks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">current</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FiberNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">workInProgress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FiberNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Component</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">props</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.memoizedState </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ReactCurrentDispatcher.current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HooksDispatcherOnUpdate;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ReactCurrentDispatcher.current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HooksDispatcherOnMount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> children</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Component</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(props);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ReactCurrentDispatcher.current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ContextOnlyDispatcher;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> children;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>渲染结束后 Dispatcher 被设置为 <code>ContextOnlyDispatcher</code>，此时调用任何 Hook 都会报错，防止在组件函数体外使用 Hook。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"usestate-的实现\">useState 的实现</h2><h3 id=\"mount-阶段\">Mount 阶段</h3><p>首次渲染时，<code>mountState</code> 创建一个新的 Hook 节点并加入链表：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function mountState&lt;S&gt;(initialState: S | (() =&gt; S)): [S, (action: S | ((prev: S) =&gt; S)) =&gt; void] {&#10;  const hook = mountWorkInProgressHook();&#10;&#10;  if (typeof initialState === &#39;function&#39;) {&#10;    initialState = (initialState as () =&gt; S)();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  hook.memoizedState = initialState;&#10;  hook.baseState = initialState;&#10;&#10;  const queue: UpdateQueue&lt;S&gt; = {&#10;    pending: null,&#10;    dispatch: null,&#10;    lastRenderedReducer: basicStateReducer,&#10;    lastRenderedState: initialState,&#10;  };&#10;  hook.queue = queue;&#10;&#10;  const dispatch = (queue.dispatch = dispatchSetState.bind(null, currentlyRenderingFiber, queue));&#10;&#10;  return [hook.memoizedState, dispatch];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mountState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">S</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">initialState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> S</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (() </span><span style=\"color:#