(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">prev</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> S</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> S</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> S</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> typeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> action </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'function'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (action </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">prev</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> S</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> S</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)(state) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> action;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>useState</code> 本质上是 <code>useReducer</code> 的语法糖，它使用内置的 <code>basicStateReducer</code> 作为 reducer 函数。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"hook-链表与调用顺序\">Hook 链表与调用顺序</h2><p>React 依赖 Hook 的<strong>调用顺序</strong>来匹配 Mount 和 Update 阶段的 Hook。第 N 次调用 Hook 对应链表中第 N 个节点。这就是 <strong>Rules of Hooks</strong> 的根本原因。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Mount&#10;        M1[&quot;第1次调用 → Hook#1&quot;]&#10;        M2[&quot;第2次调用 → Hook#2&quot;]&#10;        M3[&quot;第3次调用 → Hook#3&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Update&#10;        U1[&quot;第1次调用 → Hook#1&quot;]&#10;        U2[&quot;第2次调用 → Hook#2&quot;]&#10;        U3[&quot;第3次调用 → Hook#3&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    M1 -.-&gt;|顺序必须一致| U1&#10;    M2 -.-&gt;|顺序必须一致| U2&#10;    M3 -.-&gt;|顺序必须一致| U3\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Mount\n        M1[\"第1次调用 → Hook#1\"]\n        M2[\"第2次调用 → Hook#2\"]\n        M3[\"第3次调用 → Hook#3\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Update\n        U1[\"第1次调用 → Hook#1\"]\n        U2[\"第2次调用 → Hook#2\"]\n        U3[\"第3次调用 → Hook#3\"]\n    end\n    M1 -.-&gt;|顺序必须一致| U1\n    M2 -.-&gt;|顺序必须一致| U2\n    M3 -.-&gt;|顺序必须一致| U3</pre><h3 id=\"违反规则的后果\">违反规则的后果</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function BrokenComponent({ showExtra }: { showExtra: boolean }) {&#10;  const [name, setName] = useState(&#39;&#39;);&#10;&#10;  if (showExtra) {&#10;    const [extra, setExtra] = useState(&#39;&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);&#10;&#10;  return null;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function BrokenComponent({ showExtra }: { showExtra: boolean }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [name, setName] = useState('');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (showExtra) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const [extra, setExtra] = useState('');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渲染</th>\n<th>showExtra</th>\n<th>Hook#1</th>\n<th>Hook#2</th>\n<th>Hook#3</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首次</td>\n<td><code>true</code></td>\n<td><code>name</code></td>\n<td><code>extra</code></td>\n<td><code>count</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二次</td>\n<td><code>false</code></td>\n<td><code>name</code></td>\n<td><del><code>extra</code></del> → <code>count</code></td>\n<td>💥 错位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>当 <code>showExtra</code> 从 <code>true</code> 变为 <code>false</code> 时，Hook 调用次数发生变化，导致 Update 阶段的 Hook 与 Mount 阶段的对应关系错乱。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"rules-of-hooks\">Rules of Hooks</h2><p>基于上述实现机制，React 强制要求遵循两条规则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>只在最顶层调用 Hook</td>\n<td>保证调用顺序每次渲染一致</td>\n<td>不要在条件、循环、嵌套函数中调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只在 React 函数中调用 Hook</td>\n<td>需要 Fiber 上下文和 Dispatcher</td>\n<td>在函数组件或自定义 Hook 中调用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>使用 <code>eslint-plugin-react-hooks</code> 的 <code>rules-of-hooks</code> 规则可以在编译期捕获违规：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// .eslintrc.ts&#10;const config = {&#10;  plugins: [&#39;react-hooks&#39;],&#10;  rules: {&#10;    &#39;react-hooks/rules-of-hooks&#39;: &#39;error&#39;,&#10;    &#39;react-hooks/exhaustive-deps&#39;: &#39;warn&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// .eslintrc.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'react-hooks'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rules: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'react-hooks/rules-of-hooks'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'react-hooks/exhaustive-deps'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'warn'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Hook 以<strong>链表</strong>形式存储在 Fiber 节点的 <code>memoizedState</code> 上，按调用顺序依次链接</li>\n<li>React 通过 <strong>Dispatcher</strong> 在 Mount 和 Update 阶段切换不同的 Hook 实现</li>\n<li><code>useState</code> 是 <code>useReducer</code> 的语法糖，底层共用相同的更新队列机制</li>\n<li>Hook 的正确性依赖于<strong>调用顺序的稳定性</strong>，条件调用会导致链表错位</li>\n<li>必须遵守 <strong>Rules of Hooks</strong>：只在顶层调用、只在 React 函数中调用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Hooks 内部机制","id":"hooks-内部机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Hooks 的存储结构","id":"hooks-的存储结构"},{"level":2,"text":"Dispatcher 分发器","id":"dispatcher-分发器"},{"level":2,"text":"useState 的实现","id":"usestate-的实现"},{"level":3,"text":"Mount 阶段","id":"mount-阶段"},{"level":3,"text":"Update 阶段","id":"update-阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"Hook 链表与调用顺序","id":"hook-链表与调用顺序"},{"level":3,"text":"违反规则的后果","id":"违反规则的后果"},{"level":2,"text":"Rules of Hooks","id":"rules-of-hooks"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"调度器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/core-concepts/scheduler"},"next":{"title":"自定义 Hook 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/hooks-mastery/custom-hooks-patterns"}}